{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Slip through darkness as an incorporeal soul, <strong>possess</strong> different hosts for unique abilities and access, and <strong>evade</strong> vigilant wardens bound by holy sigils. Solve interconnected puzzles, manipulate patrols and lighting, and decide between non-lethal precision or brief bursts of vampiric force. Dynamic alert levels, multi-path level design, and branching endings reward creativity and restraint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul <strong>Possession</strong> with diverse host types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down stealth</strong> with light, noise, disguise, and evidence systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-action</strong> dual progression &amp; multi-path levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic alert</strong> and reconfigured patrols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaptered castle districts: Chapel, Greenhouse, Alchemy Tower, Catacombs, Blood Vaults, Spire</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4169480?t=1762963608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4169480?t=1762963608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169480/559f89bd0a71aa12b4faffeff35927806783c099/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762963608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169480/559f89bd0a71aa12b4faffeff35927806783c099/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762963608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Slip through darkness as an incorporeal soul, <strong>possess</strong> different hosts for unique abilities and access, and <strong>evade</strong> vigilant wardens bound by holy sigils. Solve interconnected puzzles, manipulate patrols and lighting, and decide between non-lethal precision or brief bursts of vampiric force. Dynamic alert levels, multi-path level design, and branching endings reward creativity and restraint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul <strong>Possession</strong> with diverse host types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down stealth</strong> with light, noise, disguise, and evidence systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-action</strong> dual progression &amp; multi-path levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic alert</strong> and reconfigured patrols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaptered castle districts: Chapel, Greenhouse, Alchemy Tower, Catacombs, Blood Vaults, Spire</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rajo","Monday Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169480/eb5fdaf3dade1025367d1b74285ec93bed7e2e33/header.jpg?t=1762963608","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Intel or Apple Silicon processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Where's My Body?!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3